WASTEPAY - PUBLIC WEBSITE PAGES


1. PURPOSE

The WastePay Public Website exists to:

- Build public trust.
- Convert visitors into users.
- Promote environmental sustainability initiatives.
- Display real-time impact metrics.
- Enable residential and institutional collection requests.
- Showcase WastePay's plastic intelligence and circular economy initiatives.



--------------------------------------------------


