14. LIVE PUBLIC DATA SYSTEM

Public metrics are automatically updated from WastePay's operational databases.

Examples include:

- Total KG recovered.
- Total collector payouts.
- Total barcode scans.
- Total verified products.
- Total depots.
- Total environmental impact metrics.



--------------------------------------------------


15. BUSINESS RULES

- Public metrics must exclude private user information.
- GPS collection requires user consent.
- Collection requests are geographically restricted.
- Real-time statistics are publicly accessible.
- Corporate accountability data is publicly visible.
- Individual financial information remains private.



